   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNCCI Phase II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNCCI Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det till UNCCI har inriktats p&#xe5; att st&#xe4;rka UNCCIs kapacitet f&#xf6;r att de ska utveckla sitt arbete inom handel, investeringsfr&#xe4;mjande, lobbying och b&#xe4;ttre service till medlemmarna. St&#xf6;det har varit dels direkta bidrag till UNCCI samt konsultst&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n TradeSweden AB samt &#xd6;stsvenska- och Stockholms handelskammare.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support to UNCCI has focused on strengthen capacity at UNCCI so as to enable it to fulfil its role of trade facilitation, delivery of services to members, and investment promotion.  The support has been both core funding and consultants/Swedish Chambers of Commerce</narrative>
  </description>
